# Hand-authored prose — content, not code.
#
# `format:check` has failed on every CI run in this repository's visible
# history, which made the whole gate worthless: a real formatting error in
# src/ could never be seen against 147 pre-existing warnings. Nearly all of
# them are markdown that a person wrote and a person edits.
#
# These stay out because reformatting them is an editorial act, not a
# mechanical one. `entries/` holds drafted shrine entries and field-survey
# transcriptions whose qualifying notes are the most careful writing in the
# archive (RULE 2); `docs/` holds the plans and the handover; the pipeline
# reports are generated audit trails. Prettier reflowing any of them would
# produce a large, meaningless diff over text nobody asked it to touch.
entries/
docs/
pipeline/reports/
pipeline/legacy-exports/
CLAUDE.md

